{"candidateAnswer":"Desire to share stories and inspire others","evidence":"[D19:9 | 10:22 am on 21 November, 2023] Tim: When things get tough, it's so important to remember why we love what we do. For me, it's writing and reading. That's what helps me stay motivated and push myself to get better. Has anything similar happened with basketball for you? Tell me about it!","itemId":"urn:uuid:95668885-1e14-5133-a0e4-0dacf5befd92","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:3534419ed2cf52bb1143b2c57cbae95ab0cee69825d690bb4b51ba41d0fd3ffa","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What motivated Tim to keep pushing himself to get better in writing and reading?","referenceAnswer":"Love for writing and reading","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"3534419ed2cf52bb1143b2c57cbae95ab0cee69825d690bb4b51ba41d0fd3ffa"}}]}